   "severity": "resolution of p14r findings",
   "detail": "Under the p15 dred.py my p14r toys behave correctly: eta-trace correct case returns a1*m^4 without exception (F1 false positive fixed); the premature d=4 case raises PrematureD4Substitution at the substitution (F1 false negative fixed); numeric tr ghat mixing raises NumericTraceForbidden unless display_only (F2), where the forced display reproduces the +m^4/2 (A0) and -p^2/6 (B0) shifts."
  },
  {
   "id": "F3_opaque_d_bypass",
   "severity": "informational; no released number affected",
   "detail": "OpaqueDimension guards subs/xreplace/subs-dict/evalf(subs)/limit, but expr.replace(d, 4) and sympy.lambdify bypass it (both returned 0 on the probe). A grep shows no .replace/lambdify on d in the package; all substitutions go through substitute_d with D_PROVENANCE."
  },
  {
   "id": "F4_stale_page_footer_label",
   "severity": "cosmetic",
   "detail": "All PDF pages carry the footer 'XVI-P p14 | page N' (manuscript/preamble.tex line 79, unchanged since p14r) in the p15 release. My first readback regex for the D13 T2/T3 blocks failed only because these blocks straddle a page break; after stripping footer lines all D13 T2/T3/E2 blocks read back equal in appendix and combined PDF. Entrypoint readback covers 6 classical records only, not the D13 blocks."
  },
  {
